<Programs Use="Context">
<Program Use="Context" Name="MainProgram">
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Reference" Name="Memory_Data">
</Routine>
<Routine Use="Target" Name="Memory_Informations" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================
Memory Informations : read the PLC Memory Informations

List of treatments handled by the routine :
- Get Memory Information from the controller
- Calculation Memory Datas

                                                    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
History 
		2021-Nov-17 - Merck - Q.Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.01.00.00.a
==========================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This rung performs a CIP Generic Message instruction to the User Memory Object of this Controller
It will return data on Free memory information for I/O, Data Table, and General
It will also return data on Total memroy information for I/O, Data Table, and General.
Note:  If you are not using an L55M16 the General Memory data will be zero. ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Memory_Data.Reading_Request)XIO(Memory_Message.EN)MSG(Memory_Message);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This rung jumps to the Parse routine that takes the data that is returned from the User Memory Object and places it into a User Define Data Type or easy of viewing.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Memory_Data.Reading_Request)XIC(Memory_Message.DN)JSR(Memory_Data,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset the reading request after execution]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Memory_Message.EN)XIC(Memory_Message.DN)OTU(Memory_Data.Reading_Request);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
